*This weapon is perfect for {{M|Internal Bleeding}}: with the guaranteed {{D|Impact}} proc and slow fire rate, each arrow has 70% chance to apply bleed.
**With {{M|Internal Bleeding}} + {{M|Vile Acceleration}} + {{M|Critical Delay}}, the weapon has guaranteed crit (120%), a fast charge time (0.42s), and is still just above the threshold to have 70% proc rate from Internal Bleeding.
*Due to the high headshot multiplier obtainable via [[Amalgam Daikyu Target Acquired]], and the quirk of [[Damage/Gas Damage|Gas]] status effects being able to headshot, it's a very strong pairing to run Gas on this weapon, as the Gas clouds can take full advantage of Target Acquired.

